# Using the marble set

This pack only adds 3D models. **Poggy Chess** is what puts them on a table.

## 1. Start the pack first

In `server.cfg`, this pack must start before Poggy Chess:

```
ensure poggy_core
ensure poggy_chess_props
ensure poggy_chess
```

## 2. That is all

Poggy Chess 2.2.0 or newer uses the marble board and pieces at every table as soon as this
pack is running. Checkers is played on the marble board with the game's own chips.

## Going back to the wooden set

Open **/poggy** → **Chess & Checkers** → **Tables** and turn off **Marble board and
pieces**, then Save & Restart. Stopping this pack does the same: Poggy Chess falls back to
the game's own set by itself.
